@baseUrl = http://localhost:10000

### Stored predictions (add Basic Authorization when configured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?date=2026-11-01

### Highest BTTS agreement first; sorting applies before pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?date=2026-11-04&sort=btts-agreement&direction=desc&lang=mk

### Lowest known average source probability first; unknown values remain last
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?date=2026-11-04&sort=result-probability&direction=asc

### Unsupported sorting returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?date=2026-11-04&sort=unsupported

### Stored tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets?from=2026-09-24&to=2026-11-01

### Ticket details
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/75

### Missing ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/9223372036854775807

### Simulation ROI
GET {{baseUrl}}/performance?from=2026-09-24&to=2026-11-01

### Strict league statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/leagues?from=2026-09-24&to=2026-11-01

### Invalid date returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/predictions?date=invalid
